/*
  ceremonies/phishing/identity_weak.spthy -- the WEAK identity interface (ROADMAP #5).
  The human forms its belief from the DISPLAYED claim alone -- no verification. So a spoofed display
  ('Blake' over the adversary channel) produces a FALSE belief, which the Attentive human then acts on.
  (Consumes the linear Claimed/Channel, so belief formation is bounded.)
*/

rule Believe_weak:
    [ Claimed('Alex', c), Channel('Alex', ch) ]
  --[ Believes('Alex', c, 'weak') ]->
    [ Belief('Alex', c, ch) ]
